     * Chandel (MH, code 7511): [i=1, j=1] (17.25°N, 73.75°E), ERA5 = 507.3 m, true dz_ERA5 = +341.8 m, dT = -2.22 °C.
     * Halagadaka Estate (KA, code 22152): [i=17, j=8] (13.25°N, 75.50°E), ERA5 = 812.1 m, true dz_ERA5 = +423.4 m, dT = -2.75 °C.
     * Kudremukh Notified Area (KA, code 22063): [i=17, j=7] (13.25°N, 75.25°E), ERA5 = 528.6 m, true dz_ERA5 = +461.6 m, dT = -3.00 °C.
